{
  "name": "Scrolling Board",
  "description": "A tall board slides down toward a pressure line just above the conveyor. Clear boxes to let the stack compact upward and buy yourself room; anything that grinds into the line crumbles and floods the belt with noise. Survive to the end of the board.",
  "howToPlay": "Tap a box and it opens together with every same-coloured box touching it — three boxes is 27 marbles, so pace yourself. The board creeps down on its own and each tap shoves it further, so a tap that takes four boxes buys the same ground as a tap that takes one. Cleared cells let the boxes below rise into them, building new same-coloured neighbours for your next tap. Anything that grinds into the red line breaks open and dumps its marbles whether you are ready or not. The pill in the top-left swaps between the tap-driven and auto-scrolling variants mid-run. If the conveyor overflows, you lose.",
